 The Senior Analyst owns the day-to-day execution of the Cash and Risk Management functions of the Treasury group within the Private Equity platform. The ideal candidate is a self-directed owner who sets a high standard for accuracy and is comfortable managing multiple priorities and overlapping deliverables in a fast-paced environment.
